{title: Chader Golpo}
{artist: Minar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Ekla prohori hoye,        [Bm]Jege thakbo sara [A]raat
[Em]Chad jeno hoy na [G]churi,        [Bm]Hoy na jeno [G]provat
[D]Jochona choriye [G]ghumube chaad,        [Bm]Cheye dekhbo [A]obiroto
[Em]Emoni ek [G]raater khuje,        Ami [Bm]jegechi [G]koto
[D]Chaad jodi [G]duchokh [D]mele,        [G]Sotti ke shwapno [Em]vabe
[Em]Matal hridoy tari mukh,        [A]Ektu chuye [D]debe
[D]Ushno chowaye,        Tara [Bm]gulu utshobe hobe [A]roto
[Em]Jochona plabone [G]veshe veshe,        [Bm]Ochena te [G]harabo
[D]Badha joto shob dure [G]thele,        [Bm]Niyom ta aaj [A]harabo
[Em]Ochin mayae [G]muche jabe,        [Bm]Moner joma shob [G]khoto
[D]Chaad jodi [G]duchokh [D]mele,        [G]Sotti ke shwapno [Em]vabe
[Em]Matal hridoy tari mukh,        [A]Ektu chuye [D]jaak
